# Social Network Ads Purchase Prediction
## Overview.
This project predicts whether a customer will purchase a product based on two features:
->Age,Estimated Salary.

The project follows a basic Machine Learning workflow, including data preprocessing, model training, and evaluation.
LIBRARIES USED :-
->NumPy
->Pandas
->Matplotlib
->Seaborn
->Scikit-Learn

1. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
This helped in understanding the relationship between Age, Estimated Salary, and Purchased.

2. Data Preprocessing

-> Split the dataset into training and testing data.
->Applied StandardScaler on:
->Age,Estimated Salary

3. ML Model Used:-
Logistic Regression


Model Evaluation
The model performance was evaluated using:
Accuracy Score,confusion_matrx

